      "content": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7t2cq",
            "text": "Qwen3.8-27B is here — a compact, deployment-friendly dense model built on the Qwen3.5 architecture, with native vision-language understanding and flexible thinking control.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6bn90",
            "text": "Two developer-facing features are worth your attention right away:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 16,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "833kq",
            "text": "reasoning_effort — dial reasoning depth up or down, per request.",
            "type": "ordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 18,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "eec13",
            "text": "Ultra-long context — 262K tokens natively, extensible to 1M with YaRN.",
            "type": "ordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8g2n0",
            "text": "Here's how to use both.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 0,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "h54s",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bjmc0",
            "text": "1. reasoning_effort: Control Reasoning Depth Per Request",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "cul3u",
            "text": "Qwen3.8 thinks by default before answering. With official support for reasoning_effort, you can now tune how hard it thinks — balancing accuracy, speed, and cost:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "dqj15",
            "text": "xhigh (default): for complex tasks that require thorough analysis",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "a53l0",
            "text": "medium: for balancing accuracy and speed",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "1tasq",
            "text": "low: for efficient reasoning that prioritizes speed and cost",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "1ap27",
            "text": "A minimal example via the OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions API:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 1,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "1rese",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7u5rq",
            "text": "One practical tip: in multi-turn agentic tasks, lower effort doesn't always mean faster end-to-end. Faster per-turn responses may come with more failures and retries, which can increase total latency and token consumption. Pick the effort level that fits the task.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 2,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4tsd0",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "7f52r",
            "text": "2. Processing Ultra-Long Contexts: 262K Native, Up to 1M with YaRN",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "dshlq",
            "text": "Qwen3.8-27B natively supports context lengths of up to 262,144 tokens. When your total length (input + output) exceeds that, enable RoPE scaling — YaRN is supported by vLLM, SGLang, and TokenSpeed.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "djbj6",
            "text": "The quickest approach is to pass the configuration as engine startup flags.",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "732vo",
            "text": "For vLLM, use",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 3,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5a35q",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "6o7lf",
            "text": "For SGLang, use",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 4,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bepom",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "3011l",
            "text": "For TokenSpeed, use",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 5,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "5vjkb",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "f17gk",
            "text": "Or modify rope_parameters inside text_config in the model's config.json:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 6,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "aha83",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "d539o",
            "text": "Two important notes:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 11,
                "offset": 33,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "e05i4",
            "text": "Open-source frameworks implement static YaRN — the scaling factor stays constant regardless of input length, which can hurt performance on shorter texts. Only enable YaRN when you actually need long contexts.",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "4kkvg",
            "text": "Tune factor to your typical context length. If your workloads usually sit around 524,288 tokens, set factor to 2.0 instead of 4.0.",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [
              {
                "key": 7,
                "length": 1,
                "offset": 0
              }
            ],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "bsfj6",
            "text": " ",
            "type": "atomic"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "85rk2",
            "text": "Deploy It Your Way",
            "type": "header-two"
          },
          {
            "data": {},
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [],
            "key": "8fi7o",
            "text": "Qwen3.8-27B is compatible with vLLM, SGLang, TokenSpeed, Unsloth, and more. For production workloads or high-throughput scenarios, see the deployment guides maintained by each framework:",
            "type": "unstyled"
          },
          {
            "data": {
              "urls": [
                {
                  "fromIndex": 6,
                  "text": "https://recipes.vllm.ai/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B",
                  "toIndex": 46
                }
              ]
            },
            "entityRanges": [],
            "inlineStyleRanges": [
              {
                "length": 4,
                "offset": 0,
                "style": "Bold"
              }
            ],
            "key": "di50e",
            "text": "vLLM: https://recipes.vllm.ai/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B",
            "type": "unordered-list-item"
          },
          {
